# Values for `wrangler dev`. Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) and fill in.
# In production these are secrets, not vars:
#   npx wrangler secret put BRIEF_TOKEN

# Opens /brief/inbox. The inbox fails closed — with no token set it answers
# 404 to everyone, including you.
BRIEF_TOKEN=""

# Optional. Any URL that should receive a copy of a brief as it lands, so a
# submission surfaces somewhere you actually look instead of only in KV.
BRIEF_WEBHOOK=""

# Optional. Posted every Android tester sign-up as it arrives, so the address
# can be added to Play Console's closed-test list without anyone reading KV.
TESTER_WEBHOOK=""

# Optional. /balim push notifications; without both the bell says "not ready"
# and nothing is sent. Generate ONCE with `node scripts/balim-vapid.mjs` —
# production has its own pair as secrets, never reuse or print it here.
BALIM_VAPID_ACIK=""
BALIM_VAPID_OZEL=""
